a regarding effect size. There is controversy regarding the appropriate choice of inactive comparator treatments as a true placebo in clinical trials of ESIs. The panel recommends that future trials of ESIs use minimal meaningful clinical difference as the measure of efficacy and paraspinal muscle injection of saline as an inactive placebo.},
